WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.027
[We] stayed at [Rev.

2
00:00:01.027 --> 00:00:06.920
Jemison’s] house and protected him while he slept, he and his family.

3
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:13.260
And anywhere he wanted to go, in or out of state, we saw fit that he would get there safely.

4
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:17.920
I think he was well satisfied.

5
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:23.480
It was just like you were a foot soldier patrolling a line of duty, you understand?

6
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.620
See that nobody disturbed the meeting.

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.840
That was our job.

8
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.520
We weren’t in a position to question him.

9
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.844
Our position was to protect him.
